From: Hummingbird <hummingbird@redhat.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Bump storybook 10.3.6->10.6.2 and follow-redirects 1.16.0->1.16.1

Upstream: https://github.com/grafana/grafana/commit/770a08e1623c3d2878cb4cad9bc7bde8eb7ec76c
Upstream: https://github.com/follow-redirects/follow-redirects/commit/9865ca45490e4d0f7b6944870318408344570aff
Upstream: https://github.com/follow-redirects/follow-redirects/commit/080a76d0e125b37bf81717368a61d5dc37aa56c8

Bump vendored storybook 10.3.6 -> 10.6.2 (CVE-2026-114125, CVE-2026-114126)
and follow-redirects 1.16.0 -> 1.16.1 (CVE-2026-111755, CVE-2026-111756 /
CVE-2026-40895). Regenerated yarn.lock and yarn offline cache; retargeted
the Grafana storybook conditions yarn patch to 10.6.2.

